<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><title>Join {@game["title"]} · Burrow</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/app.css"} /></head><body class="public-game"><main class="gp-signin"><img src={~p"/images/voltron-page-1.png"} alt="Burrow" width="100" /><h1>Come play {@game["title"]}.</h1><p>Your Burrow account gets you the game and its player community.</p><a id="continue-sign-in" class="gp-btn gp-primary" href={"/auth/login?" <> URI.encode_query(%{game: @game["slug"]})}>Sign in with Burrow</a><p :if={@signup?}>New here? <a id="game-create-account" href={"/games/#{@game["slug"]}/create-account"} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create your account</a>, then return here to sign in.</p><p :if={!@signup?}>New account registration is not open on this game page yet.</p><a href={"/games/#{@game["slug"]}"}>← Back to the game</a></main></body></html>
